{"changes":[{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":null,"id":1983,"kind":"method","name":"Prompt Caching","op":"insert","reason":"kv-cache 是单次生成内的算子层技术；Prompt Caching 是服务商跨请求持久化并复用前缀 KV 的产品化机制（含 TTL、计费），层次不同。vllm/pagedattention 是推理引擎实现，非 API 计费机制。graph.json 中无 prompt/prefix/context caching 节点。 prompt-compression 是缩短提示本身（删词、摘要），不复用计算，和前缀缓存不是一回事。","row_id":"n_01m6zq5ayzr0qef3f5","src":null,"tbl":"nodes","type":null},{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":null,"id":1991,"kind":"application","name":"Multi-hop Question Answering","op":"insert","reason":"这是一类任务（application），不是方法或基准本身；RAG、CoT 是解法，gaia 是通用助手基准。graph.json 中无 HotpotQA、MuSiQue 或多跳问答节点；二者目前仅作来源，若日后需要可作为 dataset 节点并 measures 本节点。","row_id":"n_01m6zq5ayzx67717ed","src":null,"tbl":"nodes","type":null},{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":null,"id":1999,"kind":"application","name":"Text-to-SQL","op":"insert","reason":"手工比对 graph.json（186 节点，服务器不可达，未跑 kmap resolve）：无 sql/text2sql/nl2sql/semantic parsing/数据库问答节点。这是一类任务（application），RAG 面向非结构化文本检索，in-context-learning 是其常用解法，coding-agents 面向软件工程而非查询生成；Spider、BIRD 目前仅作来源，日后可建 dataset 节点并 measures 本节点。","row_id":"n_01m6zq5ayzp71me7z0","src":null,"tbl":"nodes","type":null},{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":null,"id":2010,"kind":"method","name":"Agentic Search","op":"insert","reason":"react 是通用的推理-行动交替范式，Agentic Search 是其面向检索取证的专门化；RAG 是固定的先检索后生成流程；self-rag 由模型自评是否检索但仍是单模型内的检索增强，不是多轮工具循环；tool-use 是通用能力。graph.json 中无 agentic search/agentic RAG 节点。","row_id":"n_01m6zq5ayz7tq214fy","src":null,"tbl":"nodes","type":null},{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":"n_01m5eh84sra3k1vqv7","id":2020,"kind":null,"name":null,"op":"insert","reason":null,"row_id":"e_01m6zq5b0nz0fep4th","src":"n_01m6zq5ayzr0qef3f5","tbl":"edges","type":"in_topic"},{"at":"2026-11-09T08:35:25.689323+00:00","diff":null,"dst":"n_01m5eh84sre20p9wgw","id":2023,"kind":null,"name":null,"op":"insert","reason":n